  "idea": "Espanso: free cross-platform text expander that saves thousands of keystrokes",
  "text": "The open-source text expander that works everywhere on Windows, Mac, and Linux. Most paid snippet tools charge pricey subscriptions and fail to work inside terminal windows or design apps. Proprietary text tools lock your snippets behind cloud logins and send your sensitive keystrokes to third-party servers. Espanso is completely open-source and privacy-focused, expanding templates locally using simple YAML configuration files. You retain total data privacy while accelerating your workflow.",
